{"4230440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Foundland City Builders", "steam_appid": 4230440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New lands are calling… <br>Foundland is a city-building, resource management, and defense game where you shape unexplored terrain, establish production chains, and grow your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your territory, create forests, mines, fields, and settlement areas. Build homes, workshops, warehouses, markets, and production lines to develop your own civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting your city's needs, optimizing production, and making strategic decisions will shape the fate of your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Foundland, every choice tells a new story.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic land expansion:</strong> Unlock new areas and define your region’s production potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep production chains:</strong> Dozens of recipes and countless combinations from raw materials to final goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Population &amp; needs system:</strong> Build houses, meet your citizens’ needs, and balance growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense &amp; threat system:</strong> Protect your city against waves of enemies using structures and units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing yet strategic gameplay:</strong> A gentle city-building atmosphere combined with tactical defense elements.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New lands are calling… <br>Foundland is a city-building, resource management, and defense game where you shape unexplored terrain, establish production chains, and grow your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your territory, create forests, mines, fields, and settlement areas. Build homes, workshops, warehouses, markets, and production lines to develop your own civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting your city's needs, optimizing production, and making strategic decisions will shape the fate of your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Foundland, every choice tells a new story.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic land expansion:</strong> Unlock new areas and define your region’s production potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep production chains:</strong> Dozens of recipes and countless combinations from raw materials to final goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Population &amp; needs system:</strong> Build houses, meet your citizens’ needs, and balance growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense &amp; threat system:</strong> Protect your city against waves of enemies using structures and units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing yet strategic gameplay:</strong> A gentle city-building atmosphere combined with tactical defense elements.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Foundland is a strategic city-building and resource management game with defense elements. Expand your lands, establish production chains, grow your population, and protect your city against rising threats.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230440/130402604f04b971fa163c20ee8b377a5c5ac63d/header.jpg?t=1774302881", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230440/1ea59842a77d18f82631e874cafadadd4baff01c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774302881", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230440/1ea59842a77d18f82631e874cafadadd4